  "transcript": {
    "origin": "platform_srt（从 evidence-v2 原样逐 cue 复制；任何可读层归一化不改动本层）",
    "cues": [
      {"id":"CUE-001","start":0.04,"end":5.04,"text":"爆火一个月的sora很快就会向公众开放，但我们大部分人可能都用不上","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-001.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-001","SHOT-002","SHOT-003","SHOT-004"]},
      {"id":"CUE-002","start":5.05,"end":9.168,"text":"今天凌晨openai首席技术官接受华尔街时报的采访","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-002.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-004"]},
      {"id":"CUE-003","start":9.168,"end":11.5,"text":"他表示索尔将在年底前上线","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-003.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-004"]},
      {"id":"CUE-004","start":11.51,"end":17.014,"text":"同时直言不讳地告诉大家，索尔的成本贵得离谱，这意味着索尔上线以后","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-004.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-004"]},
      {"id":"CUE-005","start":17.014,"end":20.8,"text":"用户想使用注定得磕重金生成一条一分钟的视频","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-005.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-004"]},
      {"id":"CUE-006","start":20.81,"end":25.173,"text":"肯定比你买里一周的原价课贵，这一消息既让业内多了点期待","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-006.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-004"]},
      {"id":"CUE-007","start":25.173,"end":29.85,"text":"同时又看起来好像离大部分人很遥远，我就一个人做短视频需要氪重金","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-007.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-004"]},
      {"id":"CUE-008","start":29.85,"end":34.35,"text":"用sora吗？而且一个还不能完全模拟现实的sora为什么这么贵？","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-008.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-004"]},
      {"id":"CUE-009","start":34.71,"end":37.19,"text":"大家好，我是amber，这期我们聊聊sorry","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-009.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-004"]},
      {"id":"CUE-010","start":37.62,"end":39.164,"text":"先给一些朋友简单说一下","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-010.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-004"]},
      {"id":"CUE-011","start":39.164,"end":43.644,"text":"索尔是美国人工智能公司openai发布的纹身视频模型","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-011.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-004","SHOT-005"]},
      {"id":"CUE-012","start":43.644,"end":46.71,"text":"能根据一段文字生成长达一分钟的视频","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-012.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-005","SHOT-006"]},
      {"id":"CUE-013","start":46.72,"end":53.34,"text":"比如这几段大家看过无数次的素材，这些画面初看很惊艳，现在看也很惊艳","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-013.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-006"]},
      {"id":"CUE-014","start":53.64,"end":59.89,"text":"因为它似乎突破了ai生成视频目前最大的问题，画面连续性，稳定性，视频时长","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-014.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-006"]},
      {"id":"CUE-015","start":59.9,"end":62.443,"text":"也似乎对物理世界有了基础的理解力","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-015.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-006"]},
      {"id":"CUE-016","start":62.443,"end":67.81,"text":"正因如此才能将runway皮卡这样的ai明星公司按在地上狠狠摩擦","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-016.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-006"]},
      {"id":"CUE-017","start":67.82,"end":72.483,"text":"但sora的问题在于算力，算力还是算力，根据一位大佬的推理","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-017.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-006","SHOT-007"]},
      {"id":"CUE-018","start":72.483,"end":76.39,"text":"Sora生成一分钟的视频，用八张a幺零零的gpu","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-018.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-007"]},
      {"id":"CUE-019","start":76.4,"end":79.634,"text":"也要三小时以上，而在今天凌晨的采访中","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-019.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-007","SHOT-008"]},
      {"id":"CUE-020","start":79.634,"end":85.17,"text":"Openai的cto说生成一段二十秒长的七百二十p视频，只用了几分钟","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-020.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-008"]},
      {"id":"CUE-021","start":85.56,"end":87.56,"text":"这个具体的时间我们不得而知","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-021.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-008"]},
      {"id":"CUE-022","start":87.88,"end":93.85,"text":"可以肯定的是，Ai生成的视频难以保证每次的画面都可用，仍然很随机","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-022.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-008"]},
      {"id":"CUE-023","start":93.86,"end":97.966,"text":"你抽很多次卡也不一定能得到想要的画面，就像你约会八百次","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-023.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-008"]},
      {"id":"CUE-024","start":97.966,"end":99.43,"text":"也遇不到看着顺眼的人","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-024.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-008"]},
      {"id":"CUE-025","start":99.44,"end":105.501,"text":"这也是为啥openai ceo奥特曼四处奔波要拉七万亿投资制造ai芯片","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-025.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-008"]},
      {"id":"CUE-026","start":105.501,"end":107.41,"text":"山姆等等，你需要多少？","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-026.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-008","SHOT-009"]},
      {"id":"CUE-027","start":107.42,"end":110.088,"text":"五到七万亿大概不对","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-027.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-009"]},
      {"id":"CUE-028","start":110.088,"end":113.528,"text":"只是这比世界上几乎所有国家的GDP都要高","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-028.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-009"]},
      {"id":"CUE-029","start":113.528,"end":117.36,"text":"这也是为啥，因为答案能一路躺到两万亿的估值","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-029.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-009","SHOT-010"]},
      {"id":"CUE-030","start":117.67,"end":122.357,"text":"因为siri对算力的需求太恐怖了，用户抽的每一次卡都在烧钱","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-030.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-010","SHOT-011"]},
      {"id":"CUE-031","start":122.357,"end":127.5,"text":"另一篇报道里也写chatgpt每天要消耗五十万千瓦的电力","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-031.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-011"]},
      {"id":"CUE-032","start":127.51,"end":131.21,"text":"Sora只会更高。所以在算力没有跟上以前","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-032.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-011","SHOT-012"]},
      {"id":"CUE-033","start":131.21,"end":135.713,"text":"索尔是不会向公众开放的，即使开放订阅费也注定会极其昂贵","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-033.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-012","SHOT-013"]},
      {"id":"CUE-034","start":135.713,"end":138.61,"text":"除非openai开源部分的索尔的技术","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-034.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-013"]},
      {"id":"CUE-035","start":138.62,"end":142.18,"text":"让社区共同参与到开发和维护里，把价格打下来","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-035.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-013"]},
      {"id":"CUE-036","start":142.18,"end":144.92,"text":"但考虑到open ai毕竟又叫close ai","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-036.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-013","SHOT-014"]},
      {"id":"CUE-037","start":145.22,"end":146.79,"text":"开源肯定不切实际","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-037.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-014"]},
      {"id":"CUE-038","start":147.1,"end":152.72,"text":"再说说索尔的第二个问题，他到底能不能模拟现实，有没有理解物理世界的能力？","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-038.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-014"]},
      {"id":"CUE-039","start":152.73,"end":159.81,"text":"从官方的样片来看有但不多，比如咖啡杯里海盗船这段能看到他俩互相撞击","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-039.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-014"]},
      {"id":"CUE-040","start":159.81,"end":162.867,"text":"让水波随之而动。这基本符合物理规律","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-040.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-014"]},
      {"id":"CUE-041","start":162.867,"end":167.2,"text":"但也有很多翻车片段，最有意思的就是这个吹蜡烛的画面","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-041.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-014"]},
      {"id":"CUE-042","start":167.51,"end":173.03,"text":"什么呀，笨死了，蜡烛没吹掉，违背了物理现实，另外也有报道提到","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-042.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-014"]},
      {"id":"CUE-043","start":173.04,"end":177.134,"text":"既然siri能模拟现实，那他更要考虑到社会中的人情世故","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-043.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-014"]},
      {"id":"CUE-044","start":177.134,"end":178.96,"text":"要理解人类的复杂行为","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-044.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-014"]},
      {"id":"CUE-045","start":178.97,"end":184.342,"text":"比如现在一个人手里有一瓶娃哈哈和农夫山泉，索尔能预测这人该喝哪瓶","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-045.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-014","SHOT-015"]},
      {"id":"CUE-046","start":184.342,"end":187.86,"text":"这些都是索尔上线以前他需要解决和优化的问题","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-046.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-015"]},
      {"id":"CUE-047","start":188.16,"end":192.898,"text":"总结一下，考虑到sura的使用成本，它注定就不是给大部分人准备的","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-047.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-015"]},
      {"id":"CUE-048","start":192.898,"end":196.15,"text":"而是那些有金主爸爸养着的大型影视公司","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-048.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-015"]},
      {"id":"CUE-049","start":196.16,"end":201.73,"text":"广告公司，内容公司sora也不只是视频生成器，而是未来agi的大脑","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-049.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-015","SHOT-016"]},
      {"id":"CUE-050","start":202.27,"end":206.518,"text":"不过好在，在索尔这棵苍天大树下，正在长出缤纷的ai工具","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-050.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-016"]},
      {"id":"CUE-051","start":206.518,"end":207.47,"text":"跑道","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-051.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-016"]},
      {"id":"CUE-052","start":207.47,"end":210.24,"text":"皮卡svd，Big swords都挺香的","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-052.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-016"]},
      {"id":"CUE-053","start":210.25,"end":216.29,"text":"又不是用red和阿来才能拍电影，用手机也可以，还是那句话，Ai只是工具","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-053.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-016","SHOT-017"]},
      {"id":"CUE-054","start":216.29,"end":219.89,"text":"关键看你要讲怎样的故事，如何放大自我的魅力","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-054.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-017","SHOT-018"]},
      {"id":"CUE-055","start":220.22,"end":224.32,"text":"愿在勒紧裤腰带过日子的现在，Ai让我们都有美好的未来","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-055.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-019"]}
    ]
  },
  "knowledgeUnits": [
    {"id":"KU-01","title":"开篇公众开放与不可及冲突","importance":"core","statement":"作者开篇称 Sora 很快会向公众开放，但大部分人可能因高成本用不上。","provenance":"author_claim","timeRange":{"start":0.04,"end":5.04},"evidence":[{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-001","supports":"同时提出公众开放和多数人用不上。"},{"refType":"ocr","ref":"OCR-00013","supports":"经帧核对的硬字幕候选为‘很快就会向公众开放’。"},{"refType":"targeted_frame","ref":"TARGET-0001","supports":"开篇标题框定‘上万元/普通人’问题。"}],"confidence":"high","argument":{"claim":"很快公众开放但普通人可能不可及","evidenceUnitIds":["KU-03","KU-07","KU-08","KU-09","KU-11"],"conditions":["使用成本高"],"counterexamples":[],"actions":[],"limits":["实际价格和时间未给出"]},"unknowns":["‘很快’的日期未知。","标题上万元不是官方价格证据。"]},
    {"id":"KU-02","title":"年底前上线转述","importance":"core","statement":"作者把‘年底前上线’归因于一段 CTO 采访转述。","provenance":"author_claim","timeRange":{"start":5.05,"end":11.5},"evidence":[{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-002","supports":"给出采访语境。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-003","supports":"转述年底前上线。"},{"refType":"targeted_frame","ref":"TARGET-0006","supports":"采访人物画面与 Sora 字幕。"}],"confidence":"high","argument":{"claim":"年底前上线","evidenceUnitIds":[],"conditions":[],"counterexamples":[],"actions":[],"limits":["上线范围未说明","来源为作者转述采访"]},"unknowns":["上线是否指公众开放未知。","画面人物身份不能仅凭相貌验证。"]},
    {"id":"KU-03","title":"算力条件下的公众开放/价格预测","importance":"core","statement":"作者后文又预测：算力没有跟上以前 Sora 不会向公众开放，即使开放订阅费也会极其昂贵。","provenance":"author_claim","timeRange":{"start":127.51,"end":135.713},"evidence":[{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-032","supports":"提出算力未跟上的条件。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-033","supports":"公众开放和订阅预测。"},{"refType":"ocr","ref":"OCR-00437","supports":"OCR 在 132.5 秒识别到‘向公众开放的’局部，经源帧核对为该字幕段。"},{"refType":"targeted_frame","ref":"TARGET-0140","supports":"硬字幕显示订阅费昂贵。"}],"confidence":"high","argument":{"claim":"算力改善前不公众开放或昂贵","evidenceUnitIds":["KU-07","KU-08","KU-09","KU-10","KU-11"],"conditions":["算力未跟上且成本传导给订阅"],"counterexamples":[],"actions":[],"limits":["不是官方政策或价格"]},"unknowns":["算力何时跟上、真实政策和价格未知。"]},
    {"id":"KU-04","title":"开放时间与范围的内部张力","importance":"core","statement":"开篇‘很快向公众开放’、采访转述‘年底前上线’与后文‘算力跟上前不会向公众开放’并不完全一致；视频没有证明上线=公众开放=普通人经济可及。","provenance":"system_inference","timeRange":{"start":0.04,"end":135.713},"evidence":[{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-001","supports":"很快公众开放与多数人用不上。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-003","supports":"年底前上线。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-032","supports":"算力条件。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-033","supports":"不会公众开放/订阅昂贵。"},{"refType":"targeted_frame","ref":"TARGET-0136","supports":"开篇复核帧。"},{"refType":"targeted_frame","ref":"TARGET-0140","supports":"后文复核帧。"}],"confidence":"high","reasoning":"三组陈述的时间、产品范围与经济范围不同，视频没有提供术语定义或消解段，因此应保留张力而非选一边。","argument":{"claim":"陈述存在未消解张力","evidenceUnitIds":["KU-01","KU-02","KU-03"],"conditions":["上线、公众开放和经济可及不能自动等价"],"counterexamples":[],"actions":[],"limits":["‘很快’与算力条件均未量化"]},"unknowns":["是否可由不同发布层级或时间条件解释未知。"]},
    {"id":"KU-05","title":"作者先承认 Sora 的能力","importance":"core","statement":"作者称 Sora 能由文字生成最长一分钟的视频，并以‘似乎’限定其在连续性、稳定性、时长和基础物理表现上的正面评价。","provenance":"author_claim","timeRange":{"start":39.164,"end":67.81},"evidence":[{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-011","supports":"模型介绍；verbatim 含疑似转写‘纹身视频模型’。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-012","supports":"最长一分钟。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-014","supports":"连续性/稳定性/时长。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-015","supports":"以‘似乎’限定物理理解。"}],"confidence":"high","argument":{"claim":"样片表现惊艳且改进连续性等问题","evidenceUnitIds":["KU-06","KU-14","KU-15"],"conditions":["仅限所示样片印象"],"counterexamples":["后文吹蜡烛失败"],"actions":[],"limits":["不证明普遍能力"]},"unknowns":["样片筛选与生成条件未知。"]},
    {"id":"KU-06","title":"能力段可见示例的保守计数","importance":"supporting","statement":"39.164–67.82 秒的定向帧中至少可区分五种重复展示的示例场景：犬类近景、雪景城镇、村落、窗边斑点犬和雪地大型动物；后续还有一组 Sora/其他工具比较布局。","provenance":"visual_observation","timeRange":{"start":39.164,"end":67.82},"evidence":[{"refType":"targeted_frame","ref":"TARGET-0016","supports":"犬类近景。"},{"refType":"targeted_frame","ref":"TARGET-0017","supports":"雪景城镇。"},{"refType":"targeted_frame","ref":"TARGET-0019","supports":"村落。"},{"refType":"targeted_frame","ref":"TARGET-0021","supports":"窗边斑点犬。"},{"refType":"targeted_frame","ref":"TARGET-0023","supports":"雪地大型动物。"},{"refType":"targeted_frame","ref":"TARGET-0025","supports":"比较布局。"}],"confidence":"high","reasoning":"按视觉场景而非采样帧计数，重复帧不另算；‘至少’避免把转场外推为完整样本集。","unknowns":["视频实际使用的独立生成样本总数未知。","这些示例不能建立普遍/因果范围。"]},
    {"id":"KU-07","title":"第三方 8×A100 估算","importance":"core","statement":"作者转述‘一位大佬的推理’：Sora 生成一分钟视频，用 8 张 A100 GPU 也要三小时以上。","provenance":"author_claim","timeRange":{"start":67.82,"end":79.634},"evidence":[{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-017","supports":"来源角色为第三方推理。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-018","supports":"一分钟/8 张 A100。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-019","supports":"三小时以上。"},{"refType":"ocr","ref":"OCR-00171","supports":"OCR 读取估算表中‘8xA100…Sora 1min video’。"},{"refType":"ocr","ref":"OCR-00203","supports":"经帧核对的硬字幕为‘用8张A100的GPU’。"}],"confidence":"high","argument":{"claim":"生成算力成本很高","evidenceUnitIds":[],"conditions":["估算假设成立"],"counterexamples":[],"actions":[],"limits":["不是 OpenAI 官方参数","依据第三方估算表与口播"]},"unknowns":["完整公式、来源身份和假设未知。"]},
    {"id":"KU-08","title":"CTO 耗时转述与明确未知","importance":"core","statement":"作者转述 OpenAI CTO 称 20 秒、720p 视频只用几分钟，并明确说具体时间不得而知。","provenance":"author_claim","timeRange":{"start":79.634,"end":87.56},"evidence":[{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-020","supports":"20 秒/720p/几分钟。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-021","supports":"具体时间未知。"},{"refType":"ocr","ref":"OCR-00245","supports":"OCR 读取硬字幕‘20秒长的720P视频’。"},{"refType":"targeted_frame","ref":"TARGET-0040","supports":"‘我们不得而知’硬字幕。"}],"confidence":"high","argument":{"claim":"采访案例耗时为几分钟","evidenceUnitIds":[],"conditions":["系统条件未知"],"counterexamples":[],"actions":[],"limits":["不能与第三方估算直接比较","来源为作者转述采访"]},"unknowns":["具体分钟数及可比性未知。"]},
    {"id":"KU-09","title":"随机重试是成本乘数","importance":"core","statement":"作者称 AI 视频结果仍随机、每次不一定可用，多次抽卡也未必得到想要的画面，因此重试会增加可用结果成本。","provenance":"author_claim","timeRange":{"start":87.88,"end":122.357},"evidence":[{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-022","supports":"随机且每次不一定可用。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-023","supports":"多次抽卡未必得到想要画面。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-030","supports":"每次抽卡都在烧钱的作者归因。"},{"refType":"targeted_frame","ref":"TARGET-0048","supports":"短暂 UI-like 抽卡/结果画面。"}],"confidence":"high","argument":{"claim":"重试提高实际可用结果成本","evidenceUnitIds":[],"conditions":["创作者需要符合意图的可用画面"],"counterexamples":[],"actions":[],"limits":["无失败率统计","依据口播与失败结果/UI-like 蒙太奇"]},"unknowns":["失败率、平均重试次数、单位价格未知。"]},
    {"id":"KU-10","title":"投资、GDP 与估值只提供规模感","importance":"supporting","statement":"作者并置 5–7 万亿美元芯片投资、几乎所有国家 GDP 的比较与约 2 万亿估值，用来强化算力规模感，而没有给出到单次生成价格的量化模型。","provenance":"author_claim","timeRange":{"start":99.44,"end":117.36},"evidence":[{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-025","supports":"七万亿投资转述。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-027","supports":"五到七万亿。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-028","supports":"GDP 比较。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-029","supports":"两万亿估值。"},{"refType":"ocr","ref":"OCR-00350","supports":"OCR 读取 GDP 比较字幕。"},{"refType":"ocr","ref":"OCR-00367","supports":"OCR 读取‘一路躺到2万亿估值’。"}],"confidence":"high","argument":{"claim":"算力投资规模巨大","evidenceUnitIds":[],"conditions":[],"counterexamples":[],"actions":[],"limits":["不构成单次 Sora 成本因果模型","依据投资/GDP/估值并置"]},"unknowns":["数字口径和完整来源未知。"]},
    {"id":"KU-11","title":"用电转述与 Sora 更高推断","importance":"supporting","statement":"作者转述一篇报道称 ChatGPT 每天消耗 50 万千瓦电力，并推断 Sora 只会更高。","provenance":"author_claim","timeRange":{"start":122.357,"end":131.21},"evidence":[{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-031","supports":"用电报道转述。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-032","supports":"Sora 更高的作者推断。"},{"refType":"ocr","ref":"OCR-00412","supports":"OCR 读取‘50万千瓦的电力’。"},{"refType":"ocr","ref":"OCR-00422","supports":"OCR 读取‘Sora只会更高’。"}],"confidence":"high","argument":{"claim":"Sora 用电会更高","evidenceUnitIds":[],"conditions":["可由两类系统类推"],"counterexamples":[],"actions":[],"limits":["未展示 Sora 实测","依据 ChatGPT 用电转述"]},"unknowns":["Sora 实际能耗和单位口径未知。"]},
    {"id":"KU-12","title":"开源降价条件与 CloseAI 反驳","importance":"core","statement":"作者设想 OpenAI 部分开源、社区共同开发维护可把价格打下来，随后用 CloseAI 讽刺判断开源不切实际。","provenance":"author_claim","timeRange":{"start":135.713,"end":146.79},"evidence":[{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-034","supports":"部分开源条件。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-035","supports":"社区参与与降价。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-036","supports":"CloseAI 讽刺。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-037","supports":"作者否定可行性。"},{"refType":"targeted_frame","ref":"TARGET-0076","supports":"CloseAI 英文卡；只证明卡片存在。"}],"confidence":"high","argument":{"claim":"开源社区参与可能降价但作者认为不会发生","evidenceUnitIds":[],"conditions":["部分开源并共同维护"],"counterexamples":["作者对公司封闭形象的判断"],"actions":[],"limits":["非正式政策证据"]},"unknowns":["是否开源、是否足以降价未知。"]},
    {"id":"KU-13","title":"物理能力的有限总判断","importance":"core","statement":"作者对 Sora 的物理理解判断是‘从官方样片来看有但不多’，正例不能消除后续翻车。","provenance":"author_claim","timeRange":{"start":147.1,"end":173.03},"evidence":[{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-038","supports":"提出物理问题。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-039","supports":"‘有但不多’。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-041","supports":"转入翻车。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-042","supports":"反例评价。"}],"confidence":"high","argument":{"claim":"只有部分物理一致性而非可靠理解","evidenceUnitIds":["KU-14","KU-15"],"conditions":["仅依据所示若干样片"],"counterexamples":["吹蜡烛失败"],"actions":[],"limits":["不支持普遍范围","正例为海盗船水波"]},"unknowns":["模型内部是否理解物理未知。"]},
    {"id":"KU-14","title":"海盗船正例的可见序列","importance":"core","statement":"定向序列显示杯中船只相对运动/接触，随后液面波纹发生明显变化；这证明样片呈现该序列，不证明模型内部理解。","provenance":"visual_observation","timeRange":{"start":153.0,"end":162.0},"evidence":[{"refType":"targeted_frame","ref":"TARGET-0079","supports":"序列初始液体/容器画面。"},{"refType":"targeted_frame","ref":"TARGET-0082","supports":"船只相对靠近/接触状态。"},{"refType":"targeted_frame","ref":"TARGET-0084","supports":"液面波纹变化。"},{"refType":"shot","ref":"SHOT-014","supports":"连续视觉区间。"}],"confidence":"medium","reasoning":"前/中/后帧支持可见运动关系，但无生成过程或内部机制。","procedural":{"input":"杯中船只与液面样片","actions":["船只相对靠近","船只接触","液面产生波纹变化"],"parameters":[],"output":"局部视觉上符合作者所述","beforeFrames":["TARGET-0079"],"duringFrames":["TARGET-0082"],"afterFrames":["TARGET-0084"],"unknowns":["样片可能筛选","单例不代表普遍能力","提示词与参数未知"]},"unknowns":["提示词、参数、筛选未知。"]},
    {"id":"KU-15","title":"吹蜡烛反例的可见序列","importance":"core","statement":"前/中/后帧显示蛋糕蜡烛点燃、人物作吹气动作，之后多支火焰仍可见。","provenance":"visual_observation","timeRange":{"start":163.2,"end":169.5},"evidence":[{"refType":"targeted_frame","ref":"TARGET-0086","supports":"动作前多支蜡烛点燃。"},{"refType":"targeted_frame","ref":"TARGET-0088","supports":"人物靠近蛋糕吹气。"},{"refType":"targeted_frame","ref":"TARGET-0090","supports":"动作后多支火焰仍可见。"},{"refType":"shot","ref":"SHOT-014","supports":"连续视觉区间。"}],"confidence":"high","reasoning":"序列而非中点帧证明动作后状态。","procedural":{"input":"点燃多支蜡烛的蛋糕样片","actions":["人物靠近蛋糕","人物作吹气动作","观察动作后火焰状态"],"parameters":[],"output":"多支火焰仍可见，样片未达到预期吹灭结果","beforeFrames":["TARGET-0086"],"duringFrames":["TARGET-0088"],"afterFrames":["TARGET-0090"],"unknowns":["提示词和失败频率未知"]},"unknowns":["该失败在总体中的频率未知。"]},
    {"id":"KU-16","title":"社会行为设问不是模型测试","importance":"core","statement":"作者把现实模拟要求扩展到人情世故与复杂行为，以娃哈哈/农夫山泉选择作设问；视频没有展示 Sora 回答。","provenance":"author_claim","timeRange":{"start":173.04,"end":187.86},"evidence":[{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-043","supports":"人情世故。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-044","supports":"复杂行为。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-045","supports":"饮料选择设问。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-046","supports":"上线前需要解决。"},{"refType":"targeted_frame","ref":"TARGET-0101","supports":"AI Model/SORA 图示而非答题结果。"}],"confidence":"high","argument":{"claim":"现实模拟还需社会行为理解","evidenceUnitIds":[],"conditions":[],"counterexamples":[],"actions":[],"limits":["品牌选择只是设问","没有模型回答"]},"unknowns":["Sora 实际答案和表现未知。"]},
    {"id":"KU-17","title":"作者判断的目标受众","importance":"core","statement":"作者总结称，考虑使用成本，Sora 不是给大部分人准备的，而是面向有资金支持的大型影视、广告和内容公司。","provenance":"author_claim","timeRange":{"start":188.16,"end":201.73},"evidence":[{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-047","supports":"排除大部分人。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-048","supports":"大型影视公司。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-049","supports":"广告/内容公司。"},{"refType":"targeted_frame","ref":"TARGET-0110","supports":"资金猫/公司蒙太奇，只证明视觉隐喻。"}],"confidence":"high","argument":{"claim":"高门槛把早期受众映射到资金充足公司","evidenceUnitIds":["KU-03","KU-07","KU-09","KU-11"],"conditions":["成本判断成立"],"counterexamples":[],"actions":[],"limits":["无价格和客户名单"]},"unknowns":["实际客户构成未知。"]},
    {"id":"KU-18","title":"AGI 大脑是未证实扩大主张","importance":"supporting","statement":"作者称 Sora 不只是视频生成器，而是未来 AGI 的大脑；视频没有定义或证明该说法。","provenance":"author_claim","timeRange":{"start":196.16,"end":201.73},"evidence":[{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-049","supports":"AGI 原始主张。"},{"refType":"targeted_frame","ref":"TARGET-0114","supports":"电视墙/SORA 图示，只证明视觉配合。"}],"confidence":"high","argument":{"claim":"Sora 是未来 AGI 大脑","evidenceUnitIds":[],"conditions":[],"counterexamples":[],"actions":[],"limits":["无定义、机制、验证","仅有作者陈述与概念图"]},"unknowns":["技术含义与真实性未知。"]},
    {"id":"KU-19","title":"硬字幕恢复 PixVerse 工具名","importance":"core","statement":"结尾硬字幕和名称布局可见 Runway、Pika、SVD、PixVerse；其中 platform_srt 的 CUE-052 原样写作‘Big swords’，知识层以视觉观察记录 PixVerse，不修改逐字层。","provenance":"visual_observation","timeRange":{"start":202.27,"end":210.24},"evidence":[{"refType":"targeted_frame","ref":"TARGET-0119","supports":"画面名称布局及 Runway/Pika/SVD 字幕。"},{"refType":"targeted_frame","ref":"TARGET-0121","supports":"硬字幕清晰显示 PixVerse。"},{"refType":"ocr","ref":"OCR-00684","supports":"OCR 读取‘Runway Pika SVD’。"},{"refType":"ocr","ref":"OCR-00707","supports":"OCR 读取‘PixVerse都挺香的’。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-052","supports":"保留 SRT 原文差异。"}],"confidence":"high","reasoning":"OCR 候选与源帧硬字幕一致，允许在非 verbatim 层作明确标注的视觉文本归一化。","unknowns":["工具能力、价格和适用条件未知。"]},
    {"id":"KU-20","title":"现有工具恢复行动感","importance":"core","statement":"作者用‘不过好在’转向现有 AI 工具，并以无需 RED/ARRI、手机也能拍电影作类比，强调 AI 只是工具，关键是故事与个人魅力。","provenance":"author_claim","timeRange":{"start":202.27,"end":219.89},"evidence":[{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-050","supports":"工具生态转向。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-053","supports":"手机类比与 AI 只是工具。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-054","supports":"故事与自我魅力。"},{"refType":"targeted_frame","ref":"TARGET-0123","supports":"RED/ARRI 视觉与字幕。"},{"refType":"targeted_frame","ref":"TARGET-0127","supports":"故事/自我魅力硬字幕。"}],"confidence":"high","argument":{"claim":"创作不必依赖最高规格工具","evidenceUnitIds":["KU-19"],"conditions":["创作者能使用可得工具"],"counterexamples":[],"actions":["立即创作并重视故事与个人表达"],"limits":["无具体工作流比较"]},"unknowns":["替代工具能力与价格未知。"]},
    {"id":"KU-21","title":"CUE-055 的普惠希望收束","importance":"core","statement":"作者最后把‘勒紧裤腰带过日子的现在’转成愿景：希望 AI 让‘我们都有美好的未来’；这是情感/价值收束，不是可验证预测。","provenance":"author_claim","timeRange":{"start":220.22,"end":224.32},"evidence":[{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-055","supports":"完整希望句。"},{"refType":"targeted_frame","ref":"TARGET-0129","supports":"硬字幕第一段‘愿在勒紧裤腰带’。"},{"refType":"ocr","ref":"OCR-00756","supports":"OCR 准确读取第二段‘过日子的现在’。"},{"refType":"ocr","ref":"OCR-00761","supports":"OCR 准确读取第三段‘AI让我们都有美好的未来’。"},{"refType":"shot","ref":"SHOT-019","supports":"结尾连续视觉区间。"}],"confidence":"high","argument":{"claim":"AI 最终应让所有人拥有更美好未来","evidenceUnitIds":["KU-20"],"conditions":["希望/愿景语气"],"counterexamples":[],"actions":["在当下压力中保留普惠期待"],"limits":["不是结果保证"]},"unknowns":["愿景能否实现未知。"]},
    {"id":"KU-22","title":"音轨存在","importance":"context","statement":"evidence-v2 元数据与音频检查确认视频包含覆盖约 225.418 秒的 AAC 立体声音轨。","provenance":"raw_fact","timeRange":{"start":0.0,"end":225.418},"evidence":[{"refType":"source","ref":"SRC-AUDIO-INSPECTION","supports":"ffprobe 流参数、media.hasAudio=true、audioCodec=aac 与全时段检查记录。"}],"confidence":"high","unknowns":[]},
    {"id":"KU-23","title":"非旁白音频角色未知","importance":"core","statement":"媒体存在非静音音频，但现有波形、频谱与静音检查不能可靠区分配乐、音效或插入片段原声，也不能确定其叙事作用。","provenance":"unknown","timeRange":{"start":0.0,"end":225.418},"evidence":[{"refType":"source","ref":"SRC-AUDIO-INSPECTION","supports":"记录全时波形/频谱与仅三段短静音；roleEstablished=false。"},{"refType":"source","ref":"SRC-AUDIO-WAVEFORM","supports":"全时波形显示音频能量，但不能分离语义角色。"},{"refType":"source","ref":"SRC-AUDIO-SPECTROGRAM","supports":"全时频谱显示频率能量，但不能建立配乐、音效或插入原声的叙事作用。"}],"confidence":"high","reasoning":"确认音频流/能量不等于能识别非旁白成分；在没有可靠听证工具时显式 abstain。","unknowns":["配乐、音效、插入原声是否存在及其情绪/论证作用均未知。"]},
    {"id":"KU-24","title":"关键量化与机制答案未建立","importance":"core","statement":"视频没有建立实际公开价格、订阅方案、失败率、平均重试次数、普通用户开放日期、样片代表性、饮料设问答案或 AGI 机制。","provenance":"unknown","timeRange":{"start":0.0,"end":225.418},"evidence":[{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-021","supports":"具体生成时间未知。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-022","supports":"随机性主张但无失败率。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-033","supports":"价格/开放仅为预测。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-045","supports":"品牌选择仅为设问。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-049","supports":"AGI 仅为断言。"}],"confidence":"high","reasoning":"全时段 sweep 与 cue 问责未发现这些答案，未用外部知识填补。","unknowns":["价格","失败率","开放日期","样片代表性","饮料回答","AGI 机制"]},
    {"id":"KU-25","title":"自我介绍与说明过渡","importance":"context","statement":"作者在进入模型介绍前自我介绍为 Amber，并提示先做简单说明。","provenance":"raw_fact","timeRange":{"start":34.71,"end":39.164},"evidence":[{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-009","supports":"自我介绍；SRT 原文含 sorry。"},{"refType":"cue","ref":"CUE-010","supports":"进入说明的过渡。"}],"confidence":"high","unknowns":["SRT 中 sorry 是否为 Sora 的转写未在 verbatim 层纠正。"]}
